# Line endings for the files GitHub Pages serves verbatim.
#
# install.sh is piped straight into bash (`curl ... | bash`). With CRLF, bash reads
# `set -o pipefail<CR>` and aborts with ": invalid option nameipefail", which in turn
# breaks the pipe and makes curl report "Failed writing body". Pin LF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The PowerShell installer keeps the native Windows convention.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.py   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
